-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATA ATTRIBUTION & CITATION POLICY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software does NOT claim ownership of satellite active-fire observations.
All satellite fire detections and thermal anomaly layers processed or displayed
by this tool originate from official public datasets:

1. NASA FIRMS / LANCE (Fire Information for Resource Management System)
   - MODIS Collection 6.1 Active Fire & Thermal Anomalies (MCD14DL / MCD14ML)
     https://doi.org/10.5067/FIRMS/MODIS/MCD14DL.NRT.0061
   - VIIRS Suomi NPP 375 m Active Fire Product (VNP14IMGTDL / VNP14IMG)
     https://doi.org/10.5067/FIRMS/VIIRS/VNP14IMGT_NRT.002
   - VIIRS NOAA-20 375 m Active Fire Product (VJ114IMGTDL_NRT)
     https://doi.org/10.5067/FIRMS/VIIRS/VJ114IMGT_NRT.002
   - Official NASA FIRMS Citation Guidelines:
     https://www.earthdata.nasa.gov/data/tools/firms/faq
     Recommended acknowledgement:
     "We acknowledge the use of data and/or imagery from NASA's Fire Information
     for Resource Management System (FIRMS) (https://earthdata.nasa.gov/firms),
     part of NASA's Earth Science Data and Information System (ESDIS)."

2. CONAE (Comisión Nacional de Actividades Espaciales, Argentina)
   - Focos de Calor / OGC WMS & WFS Geoservices for Córdoba Province & Argentina:
     https://catalogos.conae.gov.ar/catalogo/catalogoGeoServiciosOGC.html
